.\" Visage — System Performance Dashboard
.TH VISAGE 1 "2026-08-21" "Visage 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
visage \- system performance dashboard
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B visage
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Visage
is a real-time system performance dashboard for Linux, providing live monitoring of CPU, memory, disk, network, GPU, sensors, and processes in a beautiful terminal UI.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-benchmark
Run CPU, memory, and disk benchmarks.
.TP
.BR \-\-remote
Start the remote monitoring HTTP server (default port 8090).
.TP
.BI \-\-remote\-host " HOST"
Remote server bind address (default: 127.0.0.1). Binding to a non-loopback address without VISAGE_AUTH_TOKEN set prints a warning at startup.
.TP
.BI \-\-remote\-port " PORT"
Remote server port (default: 8090).
.TP
.BR \-\-export
Snapshot metrics once to JSON.
.TP
.BR \-\-export\-continuous
Continuous CSV export at regular intervals. Appends to an existing file, reusing its header line.
.TP
.BI \-\-export\-interval " SECS"
Interval in seconds for continuous export (default: 5.0).
.TP
.BI \-\-export\-format " FORMAT"
Export format: \fBjson\fR (single file) or \fBjsonl\fR (JSON lines, one per line). Default: json.
.TP
.BI \-\-output " PATH"
Output path for \-\-export (default: ~/visage_snapshot.json).
.TP
.BI \-\-config " PATH"
Path to config JSON file.
.SS CI Gate Options
.TP
.BI \-\-ci\-test " EXECUTABLE"
Run the isolated CI performance benchmark gate on EXECUTABLE and exit 0 (pass) or 1 (regression).
.TP
.BI \-\-test\-args " ARGS..."
Arguments passed to \-\-ci-test executable.
.TP
.BI \-\-core " N"
Target CPU core index for isolated benchmarking (default: 0).
.TP
.BI \-\-iterations " N"
Number of iterations for benchmarking (default: 10).
.TP
.BI \-\-max\-cv " PCT"
Max allowable noise CV percentage (default: 2.0).
.TP
.BI \-\-min\-ipc " IPC"
Minimum required IPC assertion.
.TP
.BI \-\-max\-time " SECS"
Maximum allowed mean wall time in seconds.
.TP
.BI \-\-max\-ipc\-drop " PCT"
Max allowed IPC drop percentage under baseline.
.TP
.BI \-\-max\-time\-increase " PCT"
Max allowed wall time increase percentage over baseline.
.TP
.BI \-\-max\-miss\-increase " PCT"
Max allowed cache miss increase percentage over baseline.
.TP
.BI \-\-baseline " PATH"
Path to baseline benchmark JSON file.
.TP
.BI \-\-save\-baseline " PATH"
Save the current run as baseline JSON.
.TP
.BI \-\-output\-md " PATH"
Write a GitHub Actions markdown summary report.
.TP
.BI \-\-output\-json " PATH"
Write a JSON benchmark summary report.
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Show version and exit.
.SH KEYS
.SS Global Keys
.TP
.B q
Quit the dashboard.
.TP
.B r
Force refresh all metrics.
.TP
.B d
Cycle refresh speed (0.5s, 1s, 2s, 5s).
.TP
.B t
Cycle through color themes.
.TP
.B g
Cycle the active GPU in multi-GPU setups.
.SS Process Keys
.TP
.B up/down
Navigate process list.
.TP
.B PageUp/PageDown
Page through process list (10 rows).
.TP
.B s
Cycle sort mode (CPU, Memory, PID, Name). First press toggles direction.
.TP
.B a
Toggle aggregate mode (group by process name).
.TP
.B t
Toggle tree view for processes.
.TP
.B v
Toggle vim keybinding mode.
.TP
.B l
Toggle long command line display.
.TP
.B i
Open the process diagnostics deep-dive modal (FDs, sockets, threads, memory).
.TP
.B n
Renice selected process.
.TP
.B /
Filter processes by name, command line, user, or AI framework tag.
.TP
.B Enter
Open/close process detail panel.
.TP
.B x
Send signal to selected process.
.TP
.B Esc
Close popups, filter, and vim mode.
.SS Vim Mode (press v to enter)
.TP
.B j/k
Move down/up one row.
.TP
.B h/l
Move up/down 5 rows.
.TP
.B gg
Jump to first process.
.TP
.B G
Jump to last process.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I visage.json
Local configuration file.
.TP
.I ~/.config/visage/config.json
User configuration file.
.TP
.I ~/.visage.json
Alternative user configuration file.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B visage
Start the live dashboard.
.TP
.B visage \-\-remote \-\-remote\-port 9090
Start remote server on port 9090.
.TP
.B visage \-\-export \-\-output metrics.json
Export a single metrics snapshot.
.TP
.B visage \-\-export \-\-export\-format jsonl \-\-output metrics.jsonl
Export as JSON Lines (append-friendly).
.TP
.B visage \-\-ci\-test ./build/my_engine \-\-core 3 \-\-iterations 10 \-\-max\-cv 2.0
Run the CI performance gate on core 3; exits non-zero on regression.
